# calibration_box.k26mesh - a rectangular box, 2.0 by 1.0 by 1.0 m.
#
# The accepted mesh subset: `v x y z` and `f i j k`, one-based
# vertex indices, triangles only, comments with #. Metres, in the
# component's own frame. The surface is closed and wound outward,
# which the compiler checks before it integrates anything.

v -1.0 -0.5 -0.5
v 1.0 -0.5 -0.5
v 1.0 0.5 -0.5
v -1.0 0.5 -0.5
v -1.0 -0.5 0.5
v 1.0 -0.5 0.5
v 1.0 0.5 0.5
v -1.0 0.5 0.5

f 1 4 3
f 1 3 2
f 5 6 7
f 5 7 8
f 1 2 6
f 1 6 5
f 2 3 7
f 2 7 6
f 3 4 8
f 3 8 7
f 4 1 5
f 4 5 8
